  info mockopenapi.media_type route=0 op="GET /pets" line=38: The body is application/json; the response is also documented as application/xml.
  info mockopenapi.example_truncated route=0 op="GET /pets" line=38: The generated body stops where the schema refers back to itself.
  info mockopenapi.example_truncated route=1 op="POST /pets" line=95: The generated body stops where the schema refers back to itself.
  info mockopenapi.example_truncated route=6 op="GET /users/me" line=222: The generated body stops where the schema refers back to itself.
